  "body": "**Original comment by europlatus (Bitbucket: [europlatus](https://bitbucket.org/europlatus), GitHub: [europlatus](https://github.com/europlatus)).**\n\n----------------------------------------\n\nI can confirm that adjusting the Detail Protection slider yields much better results. Sorry for not having tested that earlier. I think the reason I overlooked it is because I have already done spot removal on about 30 different images and I have never adjusted the Detail Protection slider on any of those because the results were so good. Also, perhaps the name “Detail Protection” doesn’t really suggest that it helps with tone and colour? I’m not quite sure what the slider does exactly, but it worked with this issue.\n",
